35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is 5,400 yen a head a night. That is clear.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days total. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,All-in rates charge the same for everyone. Separate meals vary.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. Water runs cold.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we were together all day. No one had alone time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom for five people? That sounds rough.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train option saves us two days of travel.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, but the city beds are 12,000 to 20,000 yen.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, the inn has fixed meal times. Six and half seven.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, fixed times might be good for us. We stay together.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The separate rooms last time cost 8,000 yen different. That is unfair.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city has trains every few minutes. No planning needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The valley inn is 17,000 yen with meals. That is a lot.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The city room has a door. I can sleep better there.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The shared house year was crowded. I felt alone in the crowd.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I prefer the island. One bill, no hidden costs.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I prefer the city. Less travel, more freedom.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I prefer the city. Separate meals mean fairer costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I prefer the city. Private room, no shared bathroom.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am undecided. I need to think about the group dynamic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
