60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is the island. Option B is the hot spring. Option C is the city.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,The city saves us time. The island is too far.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
